ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service
Mataki na 2: Ƙa’idojin Kasuwanci da API Contract
Sigogi: v1.0 — Daftarin aiki don dubawa da amincewa
Harshe: Hausa
Matsayi: PROPOSED — Ba a kunna shi a production ba
Ranar shirya takarda: 12 Oktoba 2026
Wannan takarda ita ce daftarin ƙa’idojin aiki da kwangilar API na mataki na gaba. Ba ta nuna cewa an riga an ƙirƙiri database tables, endpoints, Admin UI ko payment channels ba. Duk wata hanya da aka rubuta da “PROPOSED” tana buƙatar aiwatarwa da gwaji kafin amfani.
1. Manufar mataki na 2
A saita ƙa’idoji guda ɗaya waɗanda User Side, API, Supabase da Admin Side za su bi kafin a rubuta migration ko a kunna gateway. Wannan zai rage sabani tsakanin bayanin da abokin ciniki ya gani, abin da Admin ya amince da shi, kuɗin da aka tabbatar, da aikin da aka kawo.
Abubuwan da za a samu
Ƙa’idojin request, review, quote, payment, delivery da cancellation.
API contract da endpoint names, request/response shapes da error rules.
Jerin logical database objects da ake buƙata, ba SQL migration ba.
Acceptance criteria domin gwajin tsaro da aiki.
Jerin shawarwarin kasuwanci da ke buƙatar amincewar mai ALBUKHR kafin implementation.
2. Abubuwan da ba za a karya ba
DApp Launch Service sabis ne na taimakawa masu neman gina ko ƙaddamar da Pi dApp; ba investment, staking ko liquidity product ba ne.
Nau’in sabis na farko: Pi Studio Assistance da Developer-built dApp.
Babban public workflow zai kasance Mainnet. ALBUKHR Testnet ba zai zama public service workflow ba sai an ayyana shi dabam, an ware shi, kuma an amince da shi.
Duk requests, quotes, payment records, evidence da audit events dole su kasance masu alaƙa da network kuma a tace su bisa network.
Ba a yarda da user ya karanta ko ya canja request na wani user ba. Server zai karɓi identity daga Pi token da aka tabbatar, ba daga pi_uid da browser ya aika kawai ba.
Admin permission dole ne ya fito daga tsarin authentication/authorization na ALBUKHR da ya riga ya wanzu; ba za a ƙirƙiri sabon hanyar shiga Admin mara tsaro ba.
Kar a sake amfani da verifyPaymentMetadata na liquidity ko wani financial gateway domin kuɗin wannan sabis. Ana buƙatar payment contract na musamman.
Pi U2A checkout da A2U payout abubuwa ne daban. Ba a ɗaukar A2U client a matsayin U2A checkout.
Receipt, screenshot, bank reference ko transaction ID da user ya shigar ba su tabbatar da biyan kuɗi da kansu ba.
Server API key da Supabase service-role key ba za su taɓa shiga browser bundle ko frontend code ba.
Babu Pi payment channel, bank transfer channel ko production gateway da zai kunna kafin a kammala amincewa, migration, security tests da operational verification.
Ba a yi alƙawarin cewa Pi Network zai amince da dApp, ko kuma za a samu automatic submission zuwa Developer Portal ba.
