Transition rules
submitted → under_review, needs_information, approved ko rejected.
needs_information → submitted/under_review bayan user ya amsa; a adana tarihin saƙonnin da canje-canje.
approved ba zai zama queued sai an yarda da quote/scope da ake buƙata kuma an cika payment precondition ɗin da policy ta ayyana.
in_progress ba zai tashi ba saboda payment webhook kaɗai; Admin/system workflow ne zai sa aikin ya fara.
delivered → completed bayan an cika acceptance policy; ko a koma in_progress idan an amince da gyara cikin scope.
Duk rejected/cancelled transitions suna buƙatar reason code ko bayanin dalili, actor, timestamp da audit record.
Kada a share request domin ɓoye tarihin; a yi soft cancellation/closure tare da audit trail.
