6. Public API contract
Base path da aka tsara: /api/dapp-service/v2
Matsayi: endpoints biyu na request an bayyana su a gateway audit; sauran routes na wannan sashe PROPOSED ne, ba a tabbatar da cewa an rubuta su ba.
6.1 POST /requests — aika sabon request
Authentication: Pi access token a cikin bearer header.
Request body (daftari):
{
  "project_name": "Example Pi dApp",
  "service_type": "pi_studio_assistance",
  "description": "Bayani kan manufar dApp da taimakon da ake buƙata.",
  "consent_version": "dapp-service-policy-v1"
}
Server-side checks:
Tabbatar da Pi access token ta hanyar Pi Platform API /v2/me.
Samo Pi UID da username daga amintaccen response; kada a amince da browser-provided identity.
Tabbatar da service_type, project_name, description da consent version.
Ƙayyade network daga server environment config, ba request body ba.
Rubuta request a network ɗin da gateway aka saita masa kawai.
Fara da request_status=submitted, payment_status=unpaid.
Kada a ƙirƙiri quote ko payment confirmation kai tsaye a wannan endpoint.
Success response (misali, ba final schema ba):
{
  "ok": true,
  "request": {
    "id": "server-generated-id",
    "project_name": "Example Pi dApp",
    "service_type": "pi_studio_assistance",
    "request_status": "submitted",
    "payment_status": "unpaid",
    "created_at": "server-generated-timestamp"
  }
}
6.2 GET /requests — jerin requests na mai amfani
Pi token dole ne a tabbatar da shi.
API ya samo UID daga token, ya tace ta UID da network.
Kada endpoint ya karɓi query param da zai ba user damar karanta requests na wani mutum.
A dawo da public-safe fields kawai. Kada a fallasa Admin-only internal notes, private payment evidence URL, secrets, ko sauran users.
Idan babu requests, a dawo da list mara komai, ba error ba.
