8. Quote da scope contract
Kowane quote ya kamata ya ƙunshi:
quote_id, request_id, version da status.
currency/asset da amount; kada a gauraya NGN da Pi ba tare da bayyana conversion/valuation policy ba.
scope_summary da jerin abubuwan da za a samar (deliverables).
Abubuwan da ba su cikin scope (out_of_scope).
valid_until/expiry.
Adadin revisions da ake ciki da abin da ake ɗauka a matsayin revision.
Estimated turnaround da lokacin farawa, tare da bayyana abubuwan da za su iya jinkirta shi.
Payment method ko methods da aka yarda da su da lokacin da ake buƙatar biya.
Cancellation/refund rules da acceptance/delivery procedure.
User acceptance timestamp, actor da quote version da aka karɓa.
Kada Admin ya iya canza quote da user ya riga ya karɓa ba tare da sabon quote version da sake amincewar user ba. Idan scope ya canza, a samar da change request ko sabon quote; a adana old values.
9. Pi U2A payment contract
Frontend na iya amfani da Pi SDK domin fara U2A payment; backend ne zai yanke shawarar approval/completion ta API contract da aka tabbatar.
Payment amount da metadata dole ne su fito daga active server-side quote, ba browser amount ba.
Dole a tabbatar da payment owner, app/network, quote/request link, amount, asset/currency, metadata da provider status.
Approve/complete endpoints, callbacks da retry behavior dole su zama idempotent.
Server API key yana server environment kawai.
Ba a kammala payment saboda frontend ta ce “success” kawai ba; backend/provider verification shi ne tushen gaskiya.
A rubuta payment intent, provider event IDs, verified details, timestamps da status transitions domin audit.
Kada a kunna Pi payment channel har sai an yi sandbox/testnet protocol tests, Mainnet readiness review da explicit approval.
10. Bank transfer contract
Bank details su fito daga Admin-managed configuration, ba hardcode a frontend ba.
Canjin bank destination: draft → verified/approved → active; tsohon destination a adana a audit trail.
Payment intent ya adana snapshot na destination, amount, currency, reference da expiry domin canjin bank details daga baya kada ya canza intent na baya.
Upload na receipt/statement ya shiga private storage; a duba file type, MIME, max size, malware scanning inda ya dace, da access permissions.
Evidence submission = pending_verification, ba confirmed ba.
Admin ya kwatanta trusted bank statement/transaction source da adadin, date, sender/reference da recipient kafin ya tabbatar.
Signed URLs su kasance masu gajeren expiry; kada a saka public bucket ko public permanent links.
A sa retention policy na evidence da dokar access/logging kafin production.
