Shawarwarin da nake ganin ya kamata su zama defaults
Quote-first: Admin ya duba scope sannan ya samar da quote; kada a cajin user bisa farashin da ba a tabbatar ba.
No auto-conversion: Kada a canza NGN zuwa Pi ta exchange rate da ba a ayyana ba. Idan za a karɓi Pi, a ɗauki Pi amount a matsayin server-side quote snapshot.
No fake confirmation: bank receipt ko frontend success ba su isa su tabbatar da payment ba.
Written terms before payment: user ya karɓi scope, deliverables, validity, revisions, turnaround, cancellation/refund da ownership terms kafin ya biya.
Payment and delivery remain separate: biyan kuɗi ba yana nufin an kammala dApp ba; delivery ba ya zama complete sai acceptance rules sun cika.
