14. Security and audit acceptance tests
Kafin a kunna gateway ko migration, dole a nuna gwajin da ya tabbatar da waɗannan:
Invalid/expired Pi token ba ya ƙirƙiri request.
UID da aka fake a request body ba ya canja owner identity.
User A ba zai karanta, canja, cancel ko biyan request na User B ba.
Mainnet request ba ya karanta/write Testnet rows, kuma akasin haka.
Client ba zai aika network, payment_status=confirmed, amount ko quote total da zai rinjayi server ba.
Quote expired/revoked ba zai iya karɓuwa ko amfani da shi wajen payment intent ba.
Duplicate provider callback/payment event yana haifar da event guda ɗaya kawai.
Screenshot/receipt upload ba ya sa confirmed.
Unauthorized/non-admin user ba zai kira Admin actions ba.
Admin decision yana da reason/actor/timestamp da valid transition.
Private evidence ba ya samuwa ta public URL; signed URL yana da expiry.
Error responses ba sa fallasa credentials, service-role keys, private notes ko stack traces.
Payment channel a kashe yake ta default, sai an samu explicit enablement decision.
Regression tests sun tabbatar cewa existing liquidity, investment, external-project da auth workflows ba su canza ba.
15. Tsarin aiwatarwa bayan amincewa
Mai ALBUKHR ya amince ko ya gyara business decisions na sashe na 12.
A duba ainihin code a albukhr-app, albukhr-admin da API domin daidaita endpoint names da auth middleware; kada a dogara da takardun kaɗai.
A kulle OpenAPI/API contract da response schemas.
A tsara migration SQL, constraints, RLS, storage policy da rollback plan a matsayin proposal; kada a yi apply har sai an amince.
A aiwatar da API routes a matsayin additive changes, gateway a disabled-by-default.
A aiwatar da Admin workflow da user workflow ba tare da canja Dock Navigation ko shared cores ba sai an amince dabam.
A gudanar da tests, rubuta sakamako da defects; kada a yi deployment ko kunna payments ba tare da izini bayyananne ba.
16. Abin da wannan takarda ba ta yi ba
Ba ta yi SQL write ko migration ba.
Ba ta ƙirƙiri ko canja Supabase tables, RLS, policies ko storage buckets ba.
Ba ta gyara GitHub repository ko commit ba.
Ba ta kunna API gateway, Pi payments ko bank transfer ba.
Ba ta tabbatar da cewa proposed Admin endpoints ko logical tables suna nan a live system ba.
Ba ta gyara identity RPC/security issue da aka ajiye domin daga baya ba.
17. Matakin da ake jira
Amincewa ta kasuwanci kafin implementation: farashi da currency model, SLA/turnaround, revision limit, cancellation/refund, bank reconciliation, deliverable/IP ownership da payment methods. Bayan an kulle waɗannan, mataki na gaba shi ne final API/OpenAPI contract da migration proposal, har yanzu ba a apply ba.
